{"item":{"key":"moment:2812522","id":"2812522","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"379381","name":"肥肥重工","avatar":"4dccc5172ed3309dbc504428"},"time":1662134400000,"text":"HJM每周秀中奖礼物返图，感谢[at uid=541323]@天然猪肉丸[/at] 师傅和[at uid=14311522]@波加加[/at] 老板，祝HJM每周秀越办越好。[emot=acfun,1689/]\n同时本着独乐乐不如众乐乐的精神以及一姐每次直播时都教育我们肥肥，好东西要给哥们儿掰点儿，决定顺带抽个奖。[emot=acfun,1689/]\n奖品是[at uid=179922]@1001Project[/at] 水姐喜欢的螺蛳粉一份（300gX5包），抽奖要求是有HJM成员的牌子，抽奖的口令是“抽中了送给AC娘本体”。[emot=acfun,1689/]\n我会想办法给超哥也同样寄一份，所以不用担心自己那份真的被寄给了超哥，当然选择给超哥直接寄10包我也能接受，就看超哥了。[emot=acfun,1689/]","title":"","images":["c28b010a1f052c5af8b60b60","cf083c78ec8538186969c63c"],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":136,"likeCount":43,"bananaCount":23,"shareCount":2},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/2812522","timePrecision":"day","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":135,"archivedRoots":130,"threads":{"705783656":{"pages":["comments/2812522/threads/705783656/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"705783656","root":"705783656","user":{"id":"23682490","name":"AC娘本体","avatar":"5644cb55cccd388bc266ef09"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1654/][emot=acfun,1654/]超哥不能接受！","time":1662200528912,"floor":97,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false}},"705766025":{"pages":["comments/2812522/threads/705766025/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"705766025","root":"705766025","user":{"id":"333847","name":"苟攵","avatar":"810cbd73c64a4fc43b614c91"},"text":"我的了！","time":1662198922686,"floor":83,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"705697906":{"pages":["comments/2812522/threads/705697906/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"705697906","root":"705697906","user":{"id":"379381","name":"肥肥重工","avatar":"de5ba98fd3b6e33fb2cc9451"},"text":"开奖时间是星期一